title: Building the Reichsbanner
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: reichsbanner_timer <= 0; kapp_putsch_seen == 0; reichsbanner_formed == 0
card-image: img/reichsbannerddp.jpeg
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; reichsbanner_timer += 6; rb_militarization_cost = 2 if rb_militancy > 0.1 else rb_militarization_cost = 1; rb_militarization_cost = 3 if rb_militancy > 0.25
#subtitle: Building a pro-republic paramilitary organisation.

= Building the Reichsbanner

The Kapp-Lüttwitz putsch has showed us how fragile our republic truly is and the nescecity to protect it. calls have grown from within our own ranks and among the Social Democrats and the Center for a permanent organization to defend it.

- @convince_spd: Convince the SPD leadership of building the reichsbanner by injecting joint resources.
- @convince_z: Convince the Zentrum party leadership of building the reichsbanner by injecting joint resources.
- @same: Keep the Reichsbanner negotiations as it is.
- @cut_rb: Cut funding from our party for the reichsbanner formation.
- @invest_ddp_1: Invest some resources into the formation of the reichsbanner on our own
- @invest_ddp_2: Invest heavy resources into the formation of the reichsbanner on our own.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@convince_spd
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; spd_relation += 3; rb_founding_progress += 2; rb_spd_influence += 1; rb_ddp_influence += 1; rb_z_influence -= 2

We press our case with the Social Democratic leadership. They are broadly sympathetic, as the idea is as present in their leadership as ours. [if rb_spd_influence >= 4 : They are, however, still hesitant.]

@convince_z
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; z_relation += 2; rb_founding_progress += 1; rb_z_influence += 1; rb_ddp_influence += 1; rb_spd_influence -= 2

We press our case with the Centre party leadership, however, not every figure in the Center Party is comfortable attaching their name to what could look like a paramilitary organization. 


@same
on-arrival: rb_z_influence += 1; rb_spd_influence += 1; rb_ddp_influence -= 2

We are currently unable to invest in the reichsbanner. Because of this the other parties gain influence in the reichsbanner.

- @return: Continue...


@cut_rb
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: resources += 1; rb_founding_progress -= 2; linksliberale_strength -= 2; linksliberale_dissent -= 2; rb_z_influence += 1; rb_spd_influence += 2; rb_ddp_influence -= 3

We cut invested resources into the reichsbanner. The left-liberal wing of our party feels uncomfortable with this and it hurts our influence in the reichsbanner by a lot.

@invest_ddp_1
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; z_relation += 2; spd_relations += 3; rb_founding_progress += 1; rb_ddp_influence += 2; rb_z_influence -= 1; rb_spd_influence -= 1

We invest some resources into the reichsbanner's formation on our own. This increases our standing amongst the Centre and Social Democratic party, and increases our influence in the organisation.

@invest_ddp_2
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -2 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 2; z_relation += 4; spd_relations += 5; rb_founding_progress += 3; rb_ddp_influence += 4; rb_z_influence -= 2; rb_spd_influence -= 2

We invest heavy resources into the reichsbanner's formation on our own. This increases our standing amongst the Centre and Social Democratic party by a lot, and massively increases our influence in the organisation.
